 the number of tremolo marks and is an integer from 0 to 8. Note that the number of attached beams is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not included in this value, but is represented separately using the beam element. The value should be 0 for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unmeasured tremolos."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLTremolo","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLTremolo"}}}